  "rationale": "D1 of the blend spec, data-informed (not zero-shot): the second-generation hinge law (acme_normal.wsp2 D3) and the fourth-generation growth clock (acme_normal.wsp3 D1) with equal weights. The two were typed from the same train table and are different kinds of statement, an interpolation of the observed lives and a mechanism with few constants; the mean of two forecasts is never scored worse than the mean of their scores. Written after the author saw the aggregate validation scores of both members, which tie; the weights are equal, the choice one makes knowing nothing, and no other pair was tried. No number of either member was changed: the member values are copied from the two releases by tools/wsp/blend_edits.py, which chooses nothing. No fit, no search.",
